Package: mzmineOptimiser
Type: Package
Title: Parameter Optimisation for MZmine Batch Files Without Benchmark Peaks
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(given = "Amir", family = "Asakhteman", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "your.email@example.com")
  )
Description: Runs a two-phase MZmine parameter optimisation workflow from a TOML configuration file. Phase 1 samples parameter combinations on one QC file and Phase 2 validates top combinations on all QC files. The package writes optimised MZmine batch files, summary tables and diagnostic plots.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
